// w4_chain_15.kiss
// Purpose: Winternitz chain cost probe: 15 SHA2 steps in a WHILE loop
// State ports: 20 signature (67 x 32) or chain start, 21 digest, 22 public key hash
// Node 1.0.45.15 (lab peer 9101, RPC 9105), runscript dry run. Measurements (receipt = measure/receipts/<name>.json):
//   w4_chain_15: 161 instructions, success=true (W4 chain slope, 15 steps)
// Script size: 85 characters; state data in the measured call: 32 bytes. Body below is comment-free (deploy form).

LET x=STATE(20)
LET k=0
WHILE k LT 15 DO
LET x=SHA2(x)
LET k=k+1
ENDWHILE RETURN TRUE
